# Game UI Design System

Use this when adding or restyling Sim UI (not Battle). Match `src/doc/ui/reference-sim-image.png`.

The screen is a tabletop with two surfaces:

1. **Book (left)** — parchment pages, light theme: light background, dark ink. Action buttons sit **below** the page on the wood.
2. **Data (right)** — records and stats, dark theme: `data-background.png`, cream text and brass icons.
3. **Stage** — both columns sit on dark walnut `table.jpg`. A shadowed groove in the wood separates them. Do not use `wood_chip_base.png` as the sim backdrop.

## Visual identity

Hand-crafted medieval fantasy card game.

- dark walnut table (`table.jpg`)
- aged parchment book pages
- dark navy data panel
- brass / muted gold decorations
- illustrated watercolor artwork
- restrained use of color
- no modern-looking flat UI

Readability first. Prefer existing textures and CSS variables over new decoration.

## Colors

| Role         | Value                        | Use                                         |
| ------------ | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| Parchment    | `#e8dcc4`                    | Book pages only, with `parchment.png`       |
| Ink          | `#2c251d`                    | Text **on parchment**                       |
| Ink muted    | `#5c5146` / `#4a3f32`        | Secondary text on parchment                 |
| Cream        | `#f0e6c8` / `#e8dcc4`        | Text **on data panel and wood**             |
| Muted label  | `#a89880`                    | Captions on dark surfaces                   |
| Data field   | `#1a2433` / `#1a202c`        | With `data-background.png`                  |
| Data hover   | `#243044`                    | Buttons and list rows on the data panel     |
| Brown border | `#5a4b3c`                    | Book page stroke                            |
| Brass        | `--color-brass` (`#af8e67`)  | Data frames, icons, borders, section titles |
| Golden       | `--color-golden` (`#bfa14a`) | Highlights only: selection, focus, emphasis |

Global tokens live in `src/app.css`. Prefer `--color-brass` for chrome; reserve `--color-golden` for highlights. Card colors are gem images (`color_red.png`, etc.).

Do not put parchment fills or ink text on the data panel. Do not put cream-on-dark type on the book page.

## Typography

- Book and data: `Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif` (`--font-narrative`)
- Default fallback: `system-ui, Avenir, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif`
- Console only: `monospace`
- No new webfonts
- Book body: ~1.05rem, line-height ~1.7, ink on parchment
- Action buttons: Georgia, ~1rem, cream on charcoal, brass border
- Card names: system-ui (existing card pattern)

## Materials and assets

- `table.jpg` — sim (and battle) tabletop
- `parchment.png` — book pages, card name bars, crafting sheets
- `data-background.png` — data panel fill
- `cardboard.png` — card frames
- `wood_chip_base.png` — battle End Turn chip only, not sim chrome
- `images/ui/*.svg` — data-panel icons
- `images/keywords/` — card keyword icons
- `images/color_*.png` — mana pips

Load via `getAssetPath()`. Do not hardcode `/assets/...`.

## Components to reuse

| Need                         | Copy from                                                                 |
| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Book page                    | `src/lib/ui/sim/Scene.svelte`                                             |
| Action buttons               | `src/lib/ui/sim/SceneActions.svelte`                                      |
| Data panel / character       | `src/lib/ui/sim/SimData.svelte`, `Character.svelte`                       |
| Crafting overlay             | `src/lib/ui/sim/Recipe.svelte`, `Invoke.svelte`                           |
| Compact / full / battle card | `cards/CardCompact.svelte`, `cards/CardFull.svelte`, `battle/Card.svelte` |

Put new tokens in `src/app.css`. Keep component CSS in the Svelte `<style>` block.

## Do

- Left: parchment page, ink text, buttons below on the table
- Right: `data-background.png`, cream type, brass hairlines, SVG icons
- Brass for chrome; gold only as a highlight accent
- Small radii (3–6px on panels, ~8px on cards)

## Do not

- Parchment or ink-on-cream inside the data column
- `wood_chip_base.png` as the sim table
- `#1a1a1a` admin chrome, white/alpha glass, emoji icons
- `linear-gradient` modals, large radii (16–20px), Tailwind gray palettes
- New hex when an existing token or texture already covers it
